    "newRight": "assets/art/militia_instructor_1839@2x.png"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_chapter15.js",
    "sceneKey": "ch15_scene_militia_stand",
    "id": 51,
    "speaker": "虎门民团教头",
    "text": "成，你们跟紧我和弟兄们，别让打手绕到箱子后头。看见洋枪就躲，先护住人，再护住货！",
    "oldLeft": "assets/art/militia_instructor_1839@2x.png",
